{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>巴西總統選舉兩候選人支持率差距稍微收窄　互相指責藉社交平台操縱選舉</strong></p><p>・巴西總統選舉候選人支持率差距收窄<br>・兩候選人互相指控對方操縱選舉<br>・相關指控透過社交平台發布<br>・選舉競爭形勢趨於接近</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202132-巴西總統選舉兩候選人支持率差距稍微收窄互相指責藉社交平台操縱選舉\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:49.138431+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:57.912536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:08.577367+00:00","content_hash":"68674029b004e73a045bc336a4819a48b1d9671462031f7d8e794eb414593b56","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}